  "method": "Exploratory retrospective interval prediction. Exp_c only for training and scaling. Fixed Gaussian bandwidth=1. Target: next sampling mean total dry weight g/plant, initialized with measured current mean. Features use climate observed during the interval; this is conditional reconstruction, not an advance weather forecast. All individual raw samples, excluding Average/SD rows and TOP12. No binary survival or Mars probability. Destructive samples and shared greenhouse conditions prevent interpreting plants/readings as independent experiments. Only two held-out experiments; no tuning on their outcomes; no causal claim."
